{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdBmEChAckNsKhFSkZMUd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PhCw8NJ8xx16LrZ8hnnuCB","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"C:\\Projects\\ai-template-trains\\4-g3-WI-237-a515\" && git add project-trajectory/scripts/agent_dispatch.py tests/test_agent_loop_recovery.py docs/specs/parallel-wi-dispatch.md project-trajectory/PROCESS_OPTIONS.md project-trajectory/skills/byte-budget-guard/SKILL.md .claude/skills/byte-budget-guard/SKILL.md .agents/skills/byte-budget-guard/SKILL.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nWI-237: ownership claims scan ignores integration-reachable commits\n\nAn owner merging the development branch INTO a reserved train — a content-only\nsync to preempt stage-3 integration conflicts (the 2026-07-19 WI-229 field\nevent, run 20260719T105727) — imported the integrated commits' WI trailers.\ntrain_branch_evidence scanned base..tip, read those WI-226/WI-227/... trailers\nas foreign claims, and reconcile quarantined the attested, stage-3-ready train\nfail-closed (claims-unreserved-wi). Recovery needed manual state surgery.\n\nFix: bound the claim scan `^<integration-head>`. Only the train's OWN novel\ncommits — those in base..tip and NOT reachable from refs/heads/llm/integration\n— can claim a WI; a commit already reachable from the integration ref is\nintegrated history, not a claim this train is making. A genuine foreign claim\nin a novel (integration-unreachable) commit still quarantines with the same\nreason. The bound is applied once, in train_branch_evidence, so reconcile, the\nearly-end release decision, and the blocked-disposition transaction all read\nthe train's own novel evidence consistently. No signature change (the\nintegration head is read via integration_head(root); absent ref = today's\nbehavior).\n\nTests (test_agent_loop_recovery.py):\n- test_owner_dev_merge_into_reserved_train_is_not_a_foreign_claim: the WI-229\n  field shape (reservation base predating the merge) reconciles to\n  ready-to-integrate, no claims-unreserved-wi.\n- test_novel_foreign_claim_after_owner_sync_still_quarantines: the exclusion is\n  precise — a novel WI-999 claim on top still quarantines, naming ONLY the\n  novel WI, never the merged-in dev WIs.\n\nDocs: the sanctioned owner resync is documented in the dispatcher reconcile\nspec of record (parallel-wi-dispatch.md recovery table) and the PROCESS_OPTIONS\nunattended crash-safety section.\n\nByte-budget flag (byte-budget-guard): AGENTS.template.md 9978 (untouched);\nPROCESS.md 60169 (unchanged); PROCESS_OPTIONS.md 158094 -> 158557 (+463: the\nsanctioned owner dev-merge resync note in the crash-safety/reconcile section).\nBaseline re-stamped to 158,557 in the skill source + both tracked copies.\n\nFull G3 gate green: 16/16 PASS, tests+coverage 1192 passed / 4 skipped,\ncoverage >=85. ruff format + check clean.\n\nWI: WI-237\nTrain: 4-g3-WI-237-a515\nBase: 1797913eb634806dd1658d66451a94f3e972f855\nEOF\necho \"=== last 2 commits ===\"; git log --oneline -2","description":"Commit the WI-237 work with trailers"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2061,"cache_read_input_tokens":142158,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2061},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"dacfaa29-0f09-4cde-a460-8dc79d700902","uuid":"424cbc93-4561-4b86-a6d4-18844db8fe1a","request_id":"req_011CdBmEAibqB6oe6X4ixxat"}
